<title>POLAND: OPTIMUS AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>OPTIMUS AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.47 vs   0.46</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.00 vs   0.79</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.15 vs   0.54</p>
<p> Sales		   36.14 vs  23.52</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.73 vs   5.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.60 vs   9.22</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.77 vs   6.96</p>
<p> Sales		  252.25 vs 160.75</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish computer maker is Optimus SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
